{"height":419.035846724351,"width":678.0,"dpi":-1.0,"size_behavior":0,"conditions":[[0,"\u001B[38;5;232m`summarise()` has regrouped the output.\n\u001B[36mℹ\u001B[38;5;232m Summaries were computed grouped by \u001B[34mDate\u001B[38;5;232m and \u001B[34msource\u001B[38;5;232m.\n\u001B[36mℹ\u001B[38;5;232m Output is grouped by \u001B[34mDate\u001B[38;5;232m.\n\u001B[36mℹ\u001B[38;5;232m Use `summarise(.groups = \"drop_last\")` to silence this message.\n\u001B[36mℹ\u001B[38;5;232m Use `summarise(.by = c(Date, source))` for \u001B]8;;ide:help:dplyr::dplyr_by\u0007per-operation grouping\u001B]8;;\u0007 instead.\u001B[39m\n"]]}